editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-006/review-cold-prompt.md:1706:Maud was a Force. Lira had stood by the alcove wall one morning months ago while Cael talked about the six hooks of a Force fighter's build. She had been only half listening, the way you half listen to somebody explaining the weather, and she found now that she remembered every word. A Force built its weight a long way back, slow and deep, and put the whole of it behind one blow, and the blow arrived heavier than the arm that threw it had any right to make it. A Force was slow to start. A Force could not be hurried. And a Force who had been Bronze for twenty years had long since stopped trying to be hurried, and stood still, and let you come.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/state/movement-006/AUTHOR-REPORT.md:308:Against the working ranges:
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/state/movement-006/review-editorial.md:7:**Disposition: repair required for one verified continuity conflict.** The movement otherwise delivers its inspection arc, both semifinals, the Shadow-idle-state turn, and the delegation arrival with unusually strong control. The numerical primary measures are inside the edition's accepted working ranges, though the sentence distribution and readability remain materially easier and less widely spread than the formula's literal targets.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/state/movement-006/review-editorial.md:84:Method and coverage: the supplied results cover all seven chapters and 31,521 prose words. `editions/monroe-1.3/tools/formula_metrics.py` strips H1 headings and marked scene breaks, removes Markdown emphasis, treats each non-empty line as a written paragraph, splits sentences at terminal punctuation plus an opening quote/capital or paragraph end, and uses a vowel-group syllable heuristic with silent-e and `-le` adjustments. Proper names and system terms are estimated like ordinary words and can bias readability. There are no fenced system notices in this movement.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/state/movement-006/review-editorial.md:86:| Measure | Formula target | Accepted working range, where defined | Observed | Editorial reading |
