+- **Alley:** position, objectives, adaptations and costs remain unusually legible. The repair does not shorten the movement's best action or blur who performs each tactic.
+- **Reader Standard:** truthfulness, consent, restraint and care remain costly choices; violence is consequential without gore; no profanity, sexual content, metadata leakage or modernism appears.
